ROCKNIXDS Pixel engine, imported by tools/import-rnds.sh. Don't edit these files here: change them in ROCKNIXDS
(dii-ess-aye/es-rgds-rnds.patch) and import again, so both frontends stay the same.
ROCKNIXDS commit: 8b8f72cd70f0d198612ea8e6651fae71664aa97b
Local changes since that commit (speed only, frames bit-identical): RndsRaster.cpp's box painter (coverage per row and
column, the flat core, toBitmap), glyph advance and glyph bitmap memos, resize's column weights and its loop for opaque
sources, and RndsUI.cpp's text
cache keys; and one that changes frames: no bob (bob() is 0 and nextWake doesn't wake for it), as the RG DS Plus's
menu spent CPU on it all the time. Carry them into ROCKNIXDS's patch before importing again, or they are lost. Also for Banana: the insert animation on the ready screen plays 3x as fast (INS_SPEED; LAUNCH_DELAY 920 -> ~300 ms).
Also for Banana's languages (RndsRaster): a translator hook every laid-out text goes through (setTranslator; the
layout's own pieces go through lineOf/ellipsisOf untranslated), a fallback font for characters a style's font lacks
(setFallbackFont: a CJK pixel font at whole multiples of its pixel size), and line breaks between CJK characters.
And one for Banana: the game page leaves the
achievements' label and meter out when the game has none known (empty achLabel), where ROCKNIXDS always had ES's.
